---
title: "Event Storming: Пациент оплатил приём"
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph FINTECH[FinTech Domain]
        GATE[Payment Gateway Context]
        PROC[Payment Processing Context]
        VERIFY[Payment Verification Context]
    end

    subgraph CLINIC[Clinic Domain]
        VISIT[Patient Visit Context]
        NOTIF[Notification Context]
    end

    subgraph MEDICINE[Medicine Domain]
        REC[Medical Records Context]
        BILL[Billing Context]
    end

    GATE -->|PaymentReceived| PROC
    PROC -->|VerifyPayment| VERIFY
    VERIFY -->|PaymentConfirmed| PROC

    PROC -.->|PaymentCompleted| VISIT
    PROC -.->|PaymentCompleted| NOTIF
    PROC -.->|PaymentCompleted| REC

    REC -->|AddPaymentRecord| REC
    REC -->|UpdatePaymentStatus| BILL